an class="IndexRow-rank">6</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="zh">假折扣</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change IndexRow-new">新</span><data class="IndexRow-number IndexRow-new" value="131">131</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/open-weights-quarter-price"><span class="IndexRow-rank">7</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Open-weights model released with pricing at 25% of flagship</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change IndexRow-new">新</span><data class="IndexRow-number IndexRow-new" value="126">126</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/assistant-wallet"><span class="IndexRow-rank">8</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="zh">助手钱包</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change">−22%</span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="124">124</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/airline-bans-booking-agents"><span class="IndexRow-rank">9</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="zh">禁止智能体订票</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change">−21%</span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="99">99</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/super-agent-flash-model"><span class="IndexRow-rank">10</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="zh">超级智能体发布</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change">−21%</span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="80">80</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/browser-agent-permissions"><span class="IndexRow-rank">11</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Browser vendor adds a permissions prompt for agents</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="74">74</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/cloud-outage-postmortem"><span class="IndexRow-rank">12</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Postmortem of last week's inference outage</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="68">68</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/robotaxi-permit-expands"><span class="IndexRow-rank">13</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Robotaxi permit expands to two more cities</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="63">63</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/retailer-extension-recall"><span class="IndexRow-rank">14</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Retailer recalls a browser extension after a data leak</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="57">57</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/context-registry-opens"><span class="IndexRow-rank">15</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">A public registry for agent tool servers opens</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="49">49</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/zh/topic/quantum-error-rate-claim"><span class="IndexRow-rank">16</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Quantum startup claims a record low error rate</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="44">44</data></a></li></ol><p class="Index-note">红色数字是今天新成的浪。变化按 24 小时计。</p><button type="button" class="Index-more" aria-controls="index-list" aria-expanded="false">显示全部 16 个浪</button></aside></bd-island></div></section><section class="Band" aria-labelledby="band-classifieds"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-classifieds" class="Band-name">分类广告</h2></div><div class="Band-body"><ul><li>Hacker News front page and Show HN: <a href="https://hackernews.example/item/41001" lang="en">Show HN: a terminal that explains its own error messages</a></li><li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41002" lang="en">A vector database in a single file passes 4,000 stars in a day</a></li><li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41003" lang="en">Notes on giving agents a memory that survives restarts</a></li><li>Lobsters hottest: <a href="https://lobsters.example/item/41004" lang="en">A 4-bit model that runs on a three-year-old phone</a></li><li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41005" lang="en">The quiet return of RSS, by the numbers</a></li><li>Bluesky key accounts: <a href="https://bluesky.example/item/41006" lang="en">A browser vendor hints at built-in agent permissions</a></li><li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41007" lang="en">A spreadsheet engine written in 900 lines</a></li><li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41008" lang="en">What we learned from a year of agent evaluations</a></li><li>Hacker News front page and Show HN: <a href="https://hackernews.example/item/41009" lang="en">Ask HN: who still self-hosts their email?</a></li><li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41010" lang="en">Chip export rules, explained in five charts</a></li><li>DEV.to top posts: <a href="https://devto.example/item/41011" lang="en">A keyboard firmware that learns your typos</a></li></ul><p><small>示例数据。</small></p></div></section></main><footer class="Footer"><div class="Footer-top"><form class="Footer-form" method="post" action="/zh/subscribe"><label class="Footer-la