;:&quot;赤い数字はきょうできた波。変化は 24 時間の値。&quot;,&quot;showAll&quot;:&quot;16 の波をすべて表示&quot;,&quot;showFewer&quot;:&quot;上位 8 だけ表示&quot;}"><aside class="Index" aria-labelledby="index-name"><div class="Index-head"><h2 id="index-name" class="Index-name">索引</h2><span class="Index-order">波高順</span></div><ol id="index-list" class="Index-list"><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/chipmaker-board-founder-ceo"><span class="IndexRow-rank">1</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="ja">創業者 CEO 解任</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change">+63%</span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="196">196</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/ai-lab-sued-over-agents"><span class="IndexRow-rank">2</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="ja">AI 研究所がエージェントで提訴</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change IndexRow-new">新</span><data class="IndexRow-number IndexRow-new" value="181">181</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/six-banks-offline"><span class="IndexRow-rank">3</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="ja">6 銀行が停止</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change IndexRow-new">新</span><data class="IndexRow-number IndexRow-new" value="171">171</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/ai-hacking-tool-warning"><span class="IndexRow-rank">4</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="ja">AI ハッキングツール警告</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change IndexRow-new">新</span><data class="IndexRow-number IndexRow-new" value="151">151</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/frontier-model-backlash"><span class="IndexRow-rank">5</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="ja">フロンティアモデルへの反発</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-cha