ndor adds a permissions prompt for agents</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="74">74</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/cloud-outage-postmortem"><span class="IndexRow-rank">12</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Postmortem of last week's inference outage</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="68">68</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/robotaxi-permit-expands"><span class="IndexRow-rank">13</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Robotaxi permit expands to two more cities</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="63">63</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/retailer-extension-recall"><span class="IndexRow-rank">14</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Retailer recalls a browser extension after a data leak</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="57">57</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/context-registry-opens"><span class="IndexRow-rank">15</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">A public registry for agent tool servers opens</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="49">49</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/ja/topic/quantum-error-rate-claim"><span class="IndexRow-rank">16</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Quantum startup claims a record low error rate</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change"></span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="44">44</data></a></li></ol><p class="Index-note">赤い数字はきょうできた波。変化は 24 時間の値。</p><button type="button" class="Index-more" aria-controls="index-list" aria-expanded="false">16 の波をすべて表示</button></aside></bd-island></div></section><section class="Band" aria-labelledby="band-classifieds"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-classifieds" class="Band-name">案内広告</h2></div><div class="Band-body"><ul><li>Hacker News front page and Show HN: <a href="https://hackernews.example/item/41001" lang="en">Show HN: a terminal that explains its own error messages</a></li><li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41002" lang="en">A vector database in a single file passes 4,000 stars in a day</a></li><li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41003" lang="en">Notes on giving agents a memory that survives restarts</a></li><li>Lobsters hottest: <a href="https://lobsters.example/item/41004" lang="en">A 4-bit model that runs on a three-year-old phone</a></li><li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41005" lang="en">The quiet return of RSS, by the numbers</a></li><li>Bluesky key accounts: <a href="https://bluesky.example/item/41006" lang="en">A browser vendor hints at built-in agent permissions</a></li><li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41007" lang="en">A spreadsheet engine written in 900 lines</a></li><li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41008" lang="en">What we learned from a year of agent evaluations</a></li><li>Hacker News front page and Show HN: <a href="https://hackernews.example/item/41009" lang="en">Ask HN: who still self-hosts their email?</a></li><li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41010" lang="en">Chip export rules, explained in five charts</a></li><li>DEV.to top posts: <a href="https://devto.example/item/41011" lang="en">A keyboard firmware that learns your typos</a></li></ul><p><small>サンプルデータです。</small></p></div></section></main><footer class="Footer"><div class="Footer-top"><form class="Footer-form" method="post" action="/ja/subscribe"><label class="Footer-label" for="footer-email-P0-0">新しい波を、毎日一通のメールで。</label><input class="Footer-field" id="footer-email-P0-0" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"/><button class="Footer-submit" type="submit">購読する</button></form><nav class="Footer-nav" aria-label="フッター"><a class="Footer-link" href="/ja/about#height"><span class="Footer-long">波の高さの決め方</span><span class="Footer-short">高さの決め方</span></a><a class="Footer-link" href="/ja/about#own"><span class="Footer-long">自分のレーダーを動かす</span><span class="Footer-short">自分で動かす</span></a><a class="Footer-link" href="/ja/about#open"><span class="Footer-long">Atom フィード、API、オープンデータ</span><span class="Footer-short">フィード・API・データ</span></a><a class="Footer-link" href="https://github.com/daiyanze/breaker-delta">GitHub</a></nav></div><div class="Footer-art"><svg class="Footer-svg" viewBox="0 -130 1440 510" role="img" aria-label="岩の上の灯台が、うねる波と小さな帆船の上に光を走らせています"><g class="Footer-beam"><polygon points="1132,92 300,6 300,168"></polygon><polygon points="1132,92 1520,57 1520,137"></polygon></g><path class="Footer-gulls" stroke-width="2.5" d="M560,74 q10,-11 20,0 q10,-11 20,0 M640,112 q8,-9 16,0 q8,-9 16,0 M880,54 q9,-10 18,0 q9,-10 18,0"></path><path class="Footer-solid" d="M1000,310 C1034,252 1086,236 1132,236 C1182,236 1236,256 1268,310 Z"></path><polygon class="Footer-tower" stroke-width="3" points="1108,236 1118,110 1146,110 1156,236"></polygon><polygon class="Footer-red" points="1114.8,150 1149.2,150 1151.2,176 1112.8,176"></polygon><polygon class="Footer-red" points="1110.7,202 1153.3,202 1155.4,228 1108.6,228"></polygon><rect class="Footer-solid Footer-edge" stroke-width="1.5" x="1108" y="104" width="48" height="8"></rect><rect class="Footer-lamp" stroke-width="3" x="1121" y="80" width="22" height="24"></rect><polygon class="Foot